    card title "Done or doing"

A: When you tell what you did yesterday, Russian adds one more thing: did it get done?
    draw o_masha o_book

B: In English, I read a book could be ten pages or the whole thing.
    draw o_q

A: Russian has two verbs for it: one for doing, and one for done.
    draw o_pair

    erase o_masha o_book o_q o_pair

    draw speakers

    draw talk

    draw talk

A: Чита́ла you know from lesson thirty-one: she was reading, she spent time on it.
    highlight talk_2_words effect underline color #c9871a part чита́ла

    draw talk

    draw talk

A: So I asked: прочита́ла? That's чита́ла with про in front: did you get to the end?
    highlight talk_3_words effect underline color #c9871a part прочита́ла

    erase talk

    draw talk2

    draw talk2

B: Писа́ть is new: to write. And письмо́ is a letter.
    highlight talk2_2_words effect underline color #c9871a part писа́л

    draw talk2

    draw talk2

A: No. I was watching a film instead: смотре́л, a doing verb, from lesson thirty-one.
    highlight talk2_4_words effect underline color #c9871a part смотре́л

    erase talk2

    hide speakers

A: To see the difference, picture Masha's evening, вчера́ ве́чером, as a line through time.
    draw tl_axis tl_time

A: Чита́ла is a stretch along it: the reading going on, page after page.
    draw tl_open tl_band tl_doing

    erase tl_time

B: That's why it goes with how long: я чита́ла два часа́, I was reading for two hours.
    draw tl_glass tl_hours

B: Прочита́ла is the point at the end: the last page, and the book is done.
    draw tl_dot tl_link tl_done tl_closed tl_check

A: Same book: the doing verb gives the time, the done verb the result.
    draw tl_c_doing tl_c_done

    erase pageB

A: Often a done verb is the doing verb with a small piece in front.
    draw p_h1 p_h2

A: Here in the он form: чита́л, прочита́л.
    draw p_chit

B: Де́лал, сде́лал; писа́л, написа́л; смотре́л, посмотре́л.
    draw p_del p_pis p_smo

A: Four verbs, four different pieces. No rule tells you which, so learn each pair together.
    highlight p_chit_b p_del_b p_pis_b p_smo_b effect box color #c9871a

B: The endings stay lesson thirty-one's: она́ сде́лала, они́ посмотре́ли.
    draw p_end

    erase pageC

B: Кот! Что ты сде́лал?!
    draw d_cat d_milk d_bang d_masha d_line d_gloss

A: The cat has knocked over the milk. Masha is looking at the result, so it's the done verb, сде́лал.
    highlight d_line effect underline color #c9871a part сде́лал

    erase pageD

    draw q1

    quiz "Masha finished her book, to the last page: Вчера́ я ___ кни́гу. Which fits?" reveal.text "Вчера́ я прочита́ла кни́гу." reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 290 reveal.style label reveal.size 54 reveal.color #3d3833 voice b test t1
        intro: Five questions now, then your score.
        right: The book is done, so it's the done verb, with про in front.
        wrong: Did she just spend time on it, or get to the end?
        + прочита́ла
        * чита́ла

    erase q1

    draw q2

    quiz "Tom tells us about his evening: Я два часа́ ___ фильм. Which fits?" reveal.text "Я два часа́ смотре́л фильм." reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 290 reveal.style label reveal.size 54 reveal.color #3d3833 voice a test t1
        right: Два часа́ says how long, and how long goes with the doing verb.
        wrong: Is he telling us the time it took, or the result?
        * посмотре́л
        + смотре́л

    erase q2

    draw q3

    ask "Today Tom finished his letter. Type the missing word: Я ___ письмо́." answer ["написа́л","написал"] reveal.text "Я написа́л письмо́." reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 290 reveal.style label reveal.size 60 reveal.color #3d3833 voice a test t1
        keys: АБВГДЕЁЖЗИЙКЛМНОПРСТУФХЦЧШЩЪЫЬЭЮЯ
        right: Писа́л with на in front: я написа́л, the letter is done.
        wrong: Start from писа́л. Which piece goes in front?

    erase q3

    draw q4

    quiz "Masha says: Мы посмотре́ли фильм. What does it tell you?" reveal.text "Мы посмотре́ли фильм." reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 290 reveal.style label reveal.size 60 reveal.color #3d3833 voice b test t1
        right: Посмотре́ли has по in front: the done verb, so the film is finished.
        wrong: Look at the front of the verb.
        * We were watching a film.
        + We watched the film to the end.

    erase q4

    group q5 members ["q5_m","q5_moon","q5_t"]

    quiz "Masha asks Tom how he spent his evening: Что ты ___ вчера́ ве́чером? Which fits?" reveal.text "Что ты де́лал вчера́ ве́чером?" reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 290 reveal.style label reveal.size 54 reveal.color #3d3833 voice b test t1
        right: She's asking about his time, not a result, so the doing verb: что ты де́лал?
        wrong: Is she asking how he spent the time, or what he got finished?
        + де́лал
        * сде́лал

    erase q5

    text s_sum "чита́л  →  прочита́л" #3d3833 say "читал, прочитал" colors {"^про":"#8a5fa8"} x 500 y 620 font_size 60
    parallel true

A: You got {t1.score} of {t1.total}.
    results test t1 retry true pass 4

    erase s_sum

A: So in the past, you choose: писа́л for the hours at the desk;
    shape e_band thick #2a7f86 shape rect x 400 y 530 width 500 height 70 style.fill #d6eceb
    text e_doing "писа́л" #3d3833 say писал x 400 y 530 font_size 50
    text e_doing_g "how long" #2a7f86 x 400 y 455 font_size 34

B: написа́л, with its little piece in front, for a letter that's finished.
    shape e_dot #8a5fa8 shape circle x 650 y 530 radius 26 style.fill #8a5fa8
    text e_done "написа́л" #3d3833 say написал colors {"^на":"#8a5fa8"} x 830 y 530 font_size 56
    text e_done_g "done" #8a5fa8 x 830 y 455 font_size 34

A: Сего́дня я написа́л письмо́! Пока́!
    icon e_tom size 120 set twemoji x 500 y 350 or ["person"] icon_look picture of man
    text e_line "Сего́дня я написа́л письмо́! Пока́!" #3d3833 say "Сегодня я написал письмо! Пока!" colors {"^на":"#8a5fa8"} x 500 y 250 font_size 44
    text e_gloss "Today I finished my letter! Bye!" #8f887c x 500 y 195 font_size 30

